{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 2, "text": "后，坛子里的酒就会减少三分之二，剩余的酒就成糯米烧窖酒了。该酒酿好后，需要下", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 282, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "后，坛子里的酒就会减少三分之二，剩余的酒就成糯米烧窖酒了。该酒酿好后，需要下", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 282, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 3, "text": "窖存放，秋冬才取出饮用。该酒色泽呈赭墨色，带有丝状，醇香味美，滋阴壮阳，是饮品中", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 346, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "窖存放，秋冬才取出饮用。该酒色泽呈赭墨色，带有丝状，醇香味美，滋阴壮阳，是饮品中", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 346, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 4, "text": "的佳酿。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 410, "w": 145, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的佳酿。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 410, "w": 145, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 5, "text": "刺梨糯米酒。其酿造方法是：每年秋天收了糯稻以后，就采集刺梨果，将其晒干或炕", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 471, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "刺梨糯米酒。其酿造方法是：每年秋天收了糯稻以后，就采集刺梨果，将其晒干或炕", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 471, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 6, "text": "干。接着就用糯米酿酒，酒盛于大坛中，再将刺梨干放进坛里去一起浸泡。一个月以后", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 539, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "干。接着就用糯米酿酒，酒盛于大坛中，再将刺梨干放进坛里去一起浸泡。一个月以后", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 539, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 7, "text": "（时间泡得愈长愈好），酒呈酱色，醇香可口，不易醉人。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 608, "w": 953, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（时间泡得愈长愈好），酒呈酱色，醇香可口，不易醉人。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 608, "w": 953, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 8, "text": "（二）茶类", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 671, "w": 177, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）茶类", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 671, "w": 177, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 9, "text": "布依族嗜好饮茶，家中火塘上的茶罐，终日热气腾腾；以茶待客，也是布依人家的常", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 736, "w": 1459, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族嗜好饮茶，家中火塘上的茶罐，终日热气腾腾；以茶待客，也是布依人家的常", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 736, "w": 1459, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 10, "text": "规。茶叶多是自栽自制，或从山上采集一些可饮用的嫩叶和茶叶一起进行加工而成。北", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 801, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "规。茶叶多是自栽自制，或从山上采集一些可饮用的嫩叶和茶叶一起进行加工而成。北", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 801, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 11, "text": "盘江畔贞丰县的坡柳茶，黔南都匀产的毛尖茶，过去还被作为贡茶，都匀毛尖曾在巴拿马", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 865, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "盘江畔贞丰县的坡柳茶，黔南都匀产的毛尖茶，过去还被作为贡茶，都匀毛尖曾在巴拿马", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 865, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 12, "text": "博览会上获优等奖。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 925, "w": 358, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "博览会上获优等奖。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 925, "w": 358, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 13, "text": "姑娘茶。姑娘茶是布依", "bbox_px": {"x": 1254, "y": 994, "w": 406, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "姑娘茶。姑娘茶是布依", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1254, "y": 994, "w": 406, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 14, "text": "族未出嫁的姑娘精心制作的", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 1058, "w": 486, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "族未出嫁的姑娘精心制作的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 1058, "w": 486, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 198, "line_no": 15, "text": "茶叶。每年清明前，茶树萌", "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 1122, "w": 486, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "茶叶。每年清明前，茶树萌", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1174, "y": 1122, "w": 486, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
